{"id":"vod_hh_114944","vodId":"114944","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"AKB0048第一季","name_cn":"AKB0048第一季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/126537968bce5d6b572d63ee43c29e95.jpg"},"summary":"在并不遥远的未来，人类文明高度发达，外星殖民不再是幻想。然而相对高度发达的科技，娱乐事业却受到前所未有的压制。艺能活动被认为具有蛊惑和腐蚀人心的恶劣影响而遭到当局禁止。好在渴望娱乐的种子仍在发芽，名为AKB0048的偶像团体志愿为所有蓝花星的人民送去快乐和梦想，她们顶住当局的压力举行非法演唱会，并公开招募第77期研究生。受到偶像感召，本宫凪沙（岩田华怜 配音）、园智惠理（渡边麻友 配音）、蓝田织音（仲谷明香 配音）、横沟真琴（三田麻央 配音）等满怀青春梦想的女孩相继报名。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-06 15:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPl4LRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0RqnJNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG6nkp5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM8DqL1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eVOpDXoa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwp9NGXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aOYlvAEd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eXDxGNVe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b4xmrNJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b828yjre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bDkNOyka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en5QAvpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2k4pYAd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:01.978Z"}